            "id": "utt-0012",
            "start": 202.58,
            "end": 220.5,
            "duration": 17.92,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 58,
            "text": "The past was sweet, but the road ahead is longer. Fine — it's time to let go and return to the original heart of cultivation. As they say, a true man's ambition spans a thousand miles. To display might at the Great Wall, to achieve great deeds. I, Bai Xiaochun, in the span of a finger snap, the Giant Ghost in the wilderness, flying flames extinguished, from—"
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0015",
            "start": 237.41,
            "end": 268.509,
            "duration": 31.099,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 116,
            "text": "Fed up. To keep my life and safely return to the Great Wall, I had no choice but to disguise myself as a beast that died unjustly, and once again, on the eve of atonement, in the wilderness, amid waves of power rippling through the heavens, I frantically profited. Finally, as wished, I successfully ascended to Heavenly Dao Nascent Soul. I thought this journey was complete and I could happily return. Who would have thought a top-tier duel with the fate of the world as the stake seemed to change nothing — but this round's success or—"
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0021",
            "start": 291.02,
            "end": 304.273,
            "duration": 13.253,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 37,
            "text": "The Tomb Keeper, who has stood guard for over ten thousand years, in fidelity to the Great Dao, has chosen the front lines of Xuanqing City. The Underworld Emperor succession ceremony will be held in one month."
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0028",
            "start": 362.35,
            "end": 407.75,
            "duration": 45.4,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 16,
            "text": "Lives up to its reputation, indeed. Are you alright, sir? Come with me."
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0030",
            "start": 374.81,
            "end": 386.877,
            "duration": 12.067,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 32,
            "text": "I was created by the Sovereign to guard His veil and the cycle of reincarnation, to watch over the Gate of the World. All that is not orthodox may not pass through."
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0031",
            "start": 388.19,
            "end": 404.128,
            "duration": 15.938,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 48,
            "text": "As the Tomb Keeper, there are many things I should not interfere with. My hibernation is nearly over, and the time I can guard these two is running short. Now even this world is showing signs of—"
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0032",
            "start": 404.181,
            "end": 418.925,
            "duration": 14.744,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 28,
            "text": "—breaking apart. Unlike the Tomb Keeper's duty, the Underworld Emperor, with the Chaotic Spirit River, eternally guards the Spirit Palace and protects reincarnation."
          },
