            "id": "utt-0035",
            "start": 430.95,
            "end": 446.594,
            "duration": 15.644,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 38,
            "text": "Lord, actually I'm not that... Lord, haven't you made a mistake? The Underworld Emperor's throne would be better suited to my master. Fate... could it be that you..."
          },
          {
            "id": "utt-0037",
            "start": 436.97,
            "end": 452.872,
            "duration": 15.902,
            "timing_status": "partial",
            "source_chars": 28,
            "text": "to be the Underworld Emperor. I once altered the course of your life, placing you by his side."
          }
        ],
